      "id": 493237,
      "username": "centaur",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2026-02-03T15:17:51.626Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Either use the browser’s option of clearing the history and cookies when you close the browser or use Incognito mode / Private window of the Browser</p>\n<p>In both cases cookies are cleared… which should be a clean session for each user each time</p>",
