    {
      "id": 493239,
      "username": "volkswagner",
      "name": "volkswagner",
      "created_at": "2026-02-03T16:22:11.847Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"centaur\" data-post=\"8\" data-topic=\"160159\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/centaur/48/26280_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> centaur:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>use the browser’s option of clearing the history and cookies when you close the browser</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>+1</p>\n<p>You are trying to solve a browser issue, not an application issue.</p>\n<p>You can set the browser to always clear cache when it’s closed. Enable this setting and tell users to close the browser when they log off.</p>",
